    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "0eb56aab-fb7e-4c7c-816f-bd63cdbb11d0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E5* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll entrance fees included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EProfessional local guide\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flights to Heraklion\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach in Crete\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 15 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "What\u0027s included in this tour is entirely yours to customise to suit your group\u0027s budget and preferences. Here is what we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "f7df80c0-7244-4d90-b0cd-c362b158323f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ESix nights on half board basis at the 5* Anemos Luxury Grand Resort, located next to the village of Georgioupolis Chania. Overlooking the Cretan Sea, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, four outdoor swimming pools and one indoor swimming pool and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Where you stay is entirely yours to choose to match your group\u0027s preferences. Here is our suggested accommodation:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "959928cd-3405-4c20-bee3-9e46f1f7b449",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERethymnon\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFortezza Fortress\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMinoan Tombs of Armeni\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPalace of Phaistos\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERoyal Villa of Agia Triada\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAptera\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChania\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMelidoni Cave\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEleutherna\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKnossos\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHeraklion Archaeological Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EMonastery of Arkadi\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "The places your group visits are exclusively yours to decide. Here are the main sights we\u0027ve suggested:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "668ac696-50c4-4c92-914e-2a93dd7f91fd",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ERemember that this tour is just our suggestion to provide inspiration and whet your appetite. Every one of our tours is tailor made exclusively for your group and your group alone. So if you like the look of this tour but want to alter it to suit your group, that\u2019s fine. Tell us how you want to change it and we\u2019ll send you a proposal that meets the exact requirements for your group tour. Then, combining our experience with your understanding of the profile and interests of your members, together we can fine tune the itinerary so that you get the perfect tour at the right price for your group.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\nIf you\u0027d prefer to visit different places, or if you\u0027d like to add extra attractions that match your group\u0027s specific interests, here are some more suggestions:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "ce2f5fb1-9bdc-4763-a7dc-10fee4f1ecd6",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Georgioupolis Chania\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EScheduled flight to Heraklion from your preferred airport \u2013 transfer with our professional guide in our private executive coach to the 5* Anemos Luxury Grand Resort, located next to the village of Georgioupolis Chania.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Rethymnon \u0026amp; Fortezza Fortress\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA guided tour through the old town of Rethymnon with its wonderful old Venetian buildings and maze of attractive narrow streets includes a visit to the Archaeological Museum displaying exhibits from the Neolithic to Roman eras \u2013 Fortezza Fortress on Paleokastro Hill on the west side of the city was built between 1573 and 1580 by the Venetians to protect the citizens from the Turkish threat \u2013 rest of the day at leisure in Rethymnon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Minoan Tombs of Armeni, Palace of Phaistos \u0026amp; Royal Villa at Agia Triada\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EA full day focusing on the Minoan era today \u2013 at the Minoan Tombs of Armeni there are over 200 chamber tombs and one tholos tomb scattered through an olive grove \u2013 built on the most spectacular setting of all palaces in Crete, high on a dramatic hill overlooking the entire Messara plain, the Palace of Phaistos, the second largest palace of Crete after Knossos, was destroyed three times before it was rebuilt on the ruins of the old buildings in 1700 BC \u2013 the ruins of the Royal Villa at Agia Triada dating back to around 1600 BC were first excavated in 1902 and are believed to be the summer residence of the King of Phaistos.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Aptera \u0026amp; Chania\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EHeading to the west of the island, we focus on the history of the Roman, Hellenistic, Venetian and Byzantine eras \u2013 the extensive ruins of the Roman and Hellenistic site of Aptera offer spectacular views over the bay of Souda \u2013 continue to the harbour town of Chania, built on the ruins of ancient Kydonia, which according to mythology was founded by King Kydon.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Melidoni Cave \u0026amp; Eleutherna\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMelidoni Cave has been inhabited almost continuously since the Stone Age, and during Minoan times the cave was used for religious ceremonies \u2013 travel through the region of Eleutherna, considered to be one of the most important and largest ancient areas in Crete \u2013 afternoon is at leisure in our hotel.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 6 \u2013 Knossos \u0026amp; Heraklion Archaeological Museum\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EThe most famous of the Minoan palaces on the island, Knossos was undeniably the capital of Minoan Crete, as it is grander, more complex and more flamboyant than any of the other palaces on the island and was inhabited for several thousand years, beginning with a Neolithic settlement some time in the 7th millennium BC and was abandoned after its destruction in 1375 BC which marked the end of Minoan civilization \u2013 Heraklion Archaeological Museum, one of the greatest museums in Greece and the best in the world for Minoan art, houses artefacts from all the periods of Cretan prehistory and history, covering a chronological span of over 5,500 years from the Neolithic period to Roman times.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 7 \u2013 Monastery of Arkadi\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIt is thought that the first fortified group of buildings of the Byzantine Monastery of Arkadi, one of the most important centres of the Cretan resistance during the years of the Turkish occupation, was built in the 14th century BC by a monk named Arcadios and the church which stands in the middle of the fortification enclosure was built in 1587 and boasts a magnificent Baroque frontage \u2013 transfer to Heraklion Airport for our scheduled flight home.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Your itinerary is exclusively yours to tailor to suit your group\u0027s interests and profile of your members. Here is our suggested itinerary:"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember, every element of this itinerary can be adjusted. If you\u0027d like to change the days, add different activities, or adjust the pace, just let us know."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
